# Principal series
%%%
tag := "Chapter5/Discussion_principal_series_name"
number := false
%%%

The representations $`W_\mu`, $`V_{\lambda_1, \lambda_2}`, $`\lambda_1 \neq \lambda_2` are called principal series representations.
